      <CodeBlock code={"{\n \"release.openshift.io/architecture\": \"multi\",\n \"url\": \"https://access.redhat.com/errata/<errata_version>\"\n}"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>You can then begin adding multi-arch compute nodes to your cluster.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      If you see the following output, your cluster is not using the multi-architecture payload:
      <CodeBlock code={"{\n \"url\": \"https://access.redhat.com/errata/<errata_version>\"\n}"} lang="terminal" />
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
